        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accelerate our penetration across high-growth geographies: We are focused on deepening our international reach by investing in digital marketing, search engine optimization and further localization of our services, offerings and content in geographies where we are underpenetrated.",
        "start_character": 18438,
        "end_character": 18719
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we can cross sell into products such as Generative AI, Custom Content, music, and Media Manager, our digital asset management product.",
        "start_character": 20265,
        "end_character": 20413
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of these efforts, in 2023 we launched Generative AI by Getty Images and in early 2024 Generative AI by iStock, which are designed to be commercially-safe AI text to image generation services, available on gettyimages.com and istock.com.",
        "start_character": 21314,
        "end_character": 21558
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the fall of 2023, we launched Generative AI by Getty Images which is designed to be a commercially safe AI image generation service that is trained with Getty Images creative content.",
        "start_character": 3127,
        "end_character": 3313
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Opportunities for AI, data and insights: We have partnered with leading AI innovators to develop generative AI models that are designed to deliver commercially safe image and video generation and editing services.",
        "start_character": 21100,
        "end_character": 21313
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Risk Factors—Operational risks relating to our business—We may lose the right to use “Getty Images” trademarks in the event we experience a change of control.” We also own copyrights, including certain content on our web properties, publications and designs, as well as patents, including with respect to our display systems and search capabilities.",
        "start_character": 29077,
        "end_character": 29426
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we are well-positioned to continue generating revenue and cash flow by capitalizing on the increasing demand for visual content driven by long-term trends through our differentiated end-to-end content offering, our established brands and corresponding market coverage, and our strong value proposition to customers and content providers.",
        "start_character": 17204,
        "end_character": 17552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed market enhancements across e-commerce, content subscriptions, user-generated content, diverse and inclusive content, and proprietary research alongside investment in our technology platform (which includes generative AI-services designed to be commercially safe, natural language processing, and AI based integrated APIs) to become a global, trusted industry leader in the visual content space.",
        "start_character": 764,
        "end_character": 1176
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "How we hire, develop, and compensate at all levels and in all departments, including our global network of content creators, must be free from bias.",
        "start_character": 32786,
        "end_character": 32934
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-018160",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to open dialogue and provide resources and training in support of our collective learning journey.",
        "start_character": 33394,
        "end_character": 33509
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-018160",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-018160-b8c234836c5824ff",
